## Title: Macro Spellbook
## Notes: Mouseover, cursor and self-cast macros for every class spell, built in one click from a new spellbook tab with no macro syntax. They update as you level, train and swap specs. Right-click to add focus, stopcasting, auto attack, pet attack or trinkets.
